30,2,1,talk,Minato,,The earth-moving firms are worried about clay and slippage. We should avoid big digs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,It seems planted areas are way more expensive to maintain than hard surfaces.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The old basin is fine, but the paving is a mess. And many young trees died.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Our staff is tiny now, but we have volunteers for habitat and sports.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"People just want to get to the tram quickly, and the drainage is failing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, does that mean we need better drainage or just a clear path?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if the staff is low, we can't afford high-maintenance greenery.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, that matches what I saw about the dead trees. We can't just plant and forget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, the volunteers might help, but they are specialized in specific tasks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, both. The heat is high and the water has nowhere to go.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Minato,,Maybe something that doesn't require deep digging?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,Exactly. A paved area would be cheaper to keep up.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"But paving fails quickly here, according to the records.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"We have volunteers for sports and habitat, which is a strong point.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,A paved plaza might just become a heat island.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
