55,3,1,talk,Minato,,"The candidates are Woodland Walk, Market Plaza, Sports Terraces, and Wetland Restoration. I'm worried about the clay for the Wetland.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,May,,"Market Plaza is the cheapest to maintain, but Shizue says paving fails.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shizue,,The Wetland Restoration seems most durable if the basin is the model.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Sports Terraces has volunteer support, but the Woodland Walk might be too much work.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Wetland Restoration solves the drainage and heat issues.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, but the firms warned about slippage. Is that a risk for ponds?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, would the sports volunteers help with the courts?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Minato, the earlier basin worked well, so the ground can handle water.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, the youth league volunteers are very active.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the basin proves it's possible. It's better than a heat-trap plaza.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I see. If the basin is okay, maybe the Wetland is safe.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,May,,"I still worry about the cost, but if it's durable, it's better.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I vote for the Wetland. It's the most sustainable choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I'm torn, but the habitat volunteers make the Wetland viable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm voting Wetland. It addresses the actual environmental needs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go with the Wetland too.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,May,,"I'll agree, provided we don't overspend on the boardwalks.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
